title: Tea Room Area
story: dungeo
description: Solve riddle, get necklace, well puzzle, cake puzzles, carousel fix, cage puzzle. Restores from wt-09.
---

# Restore state from wt-09 (player at Living Room with torch and lantern)
$restore wt-09

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get water bottle from Kitchen (needed for well puzzle)
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get water bottle]

> east

> take bottle

> west

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Solve riddle and get pearl necklace
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Solve riddle and get pearl necklace]

# Navigate to Round Room (carousel is spinning — exits are randomized)
> open trap door

> down

> east

> north

> east

# Carousel randomizes exits — 2/8 chance of Engravings Cave per attempt
# (loop region resolved to its seed-42 sequence — ADR-294 migration)
> south

> look

# Go down to Riddle Room
> southeast

# Solve the riddle
> answer "a well"

# Enter Pearl Room (Broom Closet)
> east

> take necklace

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Well puzzle - ride bucket up to Top of Well
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Ride bucket to Top of Well]

> east

> enter bucket

> pour water

# Should now be at Top of Well
> look

> exit bucket

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Tea Room cake puzzle - get spices from Pool Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Cake puzzle and get spices]

# Go east to Tea Room
> east

# Take the cakes we need before eating eat-me cake
> take blue cake

> take red cake

# Eat eat-me cake to shrink and teleport to Posts Room
> eat eat-me cake

> look

# Go east to Pool Room
> east

# Throw red cake at pool to dissolve it and reveal spices
> throw red cake at pool

# Take the revealed spices
> take spices

# Go back to Posts Room
> west

# Eat blue cake to grow and return to Tea Room
> eat blue cake

> look

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Fix carousel and solve cage puzzle - get sphere
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Fix carousel and cage puzzle]

# Go northwest to Low Room (carousel is active - compass spinning)
> northwest

# Send robot to Machine Room
> tell robot to go east

# Follow robot east to Machine Room (exits are deterministic before button push)
> east

# Have robot push the triangular button to fix carousel
> tell robot to push button

# Send robot south to Dingy Closet for cage puzzle
> tell robot to go south

# Follow to Dingy Closet
> south

# Take sphere - triggers cage trap
> take sphere

# Tell robot to raise cage
> tell robot to raise cage

# Now take sphere successfully
> take sphere

> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case]

# Return to Living Room via well bucket and Round Room.
# The Round Room is now FIXED, but pushing the button ALSO activated the Low Room
# carousel (MDL: one CAROUSEL-FLIP flag drives both rooms oppositely — Round Room
# fixed, Low Room randomized). The Low Room's exits now scramble to Machine Room or
# Tea Room, so we bounce through it until we reach the Tea Room, exactly like the
# Round Room carousel loop above.
# Dingy Closet → Machine Room → Low Room → (bounce) → Tea Room → Top of Well → bucket
# down → Well Bottom → Pearl Room → Riddle Room → Engravings Cave → Round Room → Living Room
> north

> west

# (loop region resolved to its seed-42 sequence — ADR-294 migration)
> southeast

> west

> enter bucket

> fill bottle

> exit bucket

> west

> west

> up

> north

> west

> west

> west

> up

> open trophy case

> put necklace in trophy case

> put spices in trophy case

> put sphere in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state
# ============================================================================

